     A          R HMLIST
     A                                  1  2'Help - Message Center'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Short messages sent to you, newest-
     A                                       first.  Unread ones are bright and'
     A                                  4  3'marked with a star.  The tabs show-
     A                                       whether you are looking at your in-
     A                                      box'
     A                                  5  3'or the messages you have sent.  F1-
     A                                      0 switches between them.'
     A                                  7  3'Options: 4 deletes, 5 shows the me-
     A                                      ssage in the box at the bottom, R r-
     A                                      eplies.'
     A                                  8  3'You can also put the cursor on a l-
     A                                      ine and press Enter to pick it.'
     A                                 10  3'F6 sends a new message.  F9 sends -
     A                                      one to everybody.'
     A                                 11  3'F4 searches all of your office ite-
     A                                      ms.'
     A                                 12  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HMSEND
     A                                  1  2'Help - Send a message'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type who it is for and one line of-
     A                                       text, then press Enter.'
     A                                  5  3'To can be a user ID, the name of a-
     A                                       distribution group, or ALL for eve-
     A                                      ryone.'
     A                                  6  3'F4 opens a list of enrolled users -
     A                                      to pick from.'
     A                                  8  3'The person also gets a system mess-
     A                                      age telling them it has arrived.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
